  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Heyo, just started messing around with world space particles and decided to use the IK_follower script. I got it all set up and working by assigning the IK_follower script to a empty game object then assign that object to a bone then assign the particle to it. It works just fine without full body on but the minute I turn it on it appears to follow the wrong bone location. Spoke with a few other peeps that seem to be having this issue. If I'm correct Full body tracking has a different IK so I'm assuming that the IK_Follower isn't configured for that as of yet. If we could get set up that would be epic.\n\nThank ya!",
